    {
      "uid": "zhcn:df52f6139181f4eff43bef76",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我的记忆中，仅仅在一个时期留下了遗憾——\r\n那就是经典级的那一年。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ce4fad755aba86a62c6ee77f7c02e28052f127b377e958abade1f0cc97cf3a3f",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
