    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7864910670d101ecc0a7faba",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "丸善斯基",
      "source_fingerprint": "3a111c295c29db60e32bd168d60190c13455a98552a2c34857e1da93a365a5b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069203.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        10,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/10/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1302595ef0dc0ba4f4390b62",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我没有梦想。我只是觉得参加比赛很高兴。\r\n我只是觉得，和大家一起参加比赛、互相竞争，\r\n大家一起如风那般地尽情奔跑很开心而已。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9c08611392a42d9449579dffcae2da3e708b39b1f923ea15f503b99f0b0657ca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1069/storytimeline_501069203.json",
      "json_path": [
